      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Orofino%2C_Idaho",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Orofino boasts a rich history of logging and mining that shaped its early economy.",
